INT. RIDESHARE CAR - MOVING - NIGHT

HANDHELD. A dashboard camera and a small phone-cam on the headrest. Grainy. Streetlights smear past.

ON CAMERA: a DRIVER, 40s, hands at ten and two, eyes in the mirror. In the back seat, THE TWINS (nine, matching pyjama tops, one asleep on the other's shoulder).

DRIVER
You're sure you want me on camera? It's mostly just driving.

THE TWINS
(together, sleepy)
Yes.

DRIVER
Okay then. Hello, internet.

She laughs. The road hums.

NARRATOR (V.O.)
At two in the morning, every city looks like a memory of itself.

Red light. The car stops. Nobody speaks.

DRIVER
So. Where's your mum tonight?

THE TWINS
Hospital.

DRIVER
Oh. Sorry, love. Is she -- is she going to be all right?

THE TWINS
(together)
The baby's coming.

DRIVER
Oh! Well, that's different. That's good.

She turns round. Smiles. They don't, quite.

THE TWINS
(together, small)
We're meant to be asleep at Nan's.

DRIVER
And instead you're in a stranger's car at two a.m. with a camera pointed at you.

THE TWINS
Dad's meeting us. He said ring a cab.

DRIVER
I'm not a cab. I'm a rideshare.

THE TWINS
(together)
Is it different?

DRIVER
It's about four pounds different.

Green light. They move.

DRIVER (CONT'D)
My name's Priya, by the way. Priya. In case your dad asks.

PRIYA
(into the mirror)
You can say it back to me. So I know you know it.

THE TWINS
(together)
Priya.

PRIYA
Good. That's one safety rule down.

She taps the wheel. The hospital sign, glowing, rises out of the dark.

This is the last ride before the family changes shape.

PRIYA (CONT'D)
Nearly there. She'll have the baby by the time we find a parking space.

THE TWINS
(together)
She said that last time too.

PRIYA
And was she right?

THE TWINS
(together)
Yes.

The car slows. A man in a coat waves under the hospital canopy. The twins sit up, instantly awake.

PRIYA
There he is.

The door opens. Cold air. They climb out, hand in hand, and run.

Priya watches them go, then turns the phone-cam toward herself.

PRIYA (CONT'D)
Five stars, please. And if you're reading this, congratulations.

CUT TO BLACK.
